# @cad/{{name}}

React + Vite + vanilla-extract app scaffolded by `pnpm new-app`.

## Setup

```bash
pnpm install
```

## Dev

```bash
pnpm --filter @cad/{{name}} dev          # http://localhost:3000
```

Vite proxies `/api`, `/ws`, and `/health` to the gateway. Set `DOCKER_ENV=true` in Compose so the proxy targets `service-gateway` instead of `localhost`.

## Build

```bash
pnpm --filter @cad/{{name}} build
```

## Test

```bash
pnpm --filter @cad/{{name}} test
```

## Conventions

- Styling: `@cad/lib.ui` exports `vars.*`. Never hardcode hex or magic px.
- API calls: through `src/services/libraryServices.ts` — never raw `fetch`.
- Use `??` (not `||`) when defaulting `VITE_API_BASE_URL`.

See `.claude/skills/new-app` for the full playbook.
